        "uuid": "70092345_91d4f78c",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/include/hyp/switch.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 211,
      "author": {
        "id": 1782620
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T15:21:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The actual vector length yes, but here we\u0027re calculating the host\u0027s vector length based on ZCR_EL1, which could be bigger than the supported vector length. We use the vl the following line to calculate the offset.",
      "parentUuid": "112c91da_30371219",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 211,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 211,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "46111e069dca90a7935188ddd0caf2dcacced1b3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b971ed68_fb4f9f72",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/include/hyp/switch.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 211,
      "author": {
        "id": 1782620
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T10:04:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For more context, here\u0027s a link to the spec on accesses (read/write) to ZCR_EL1\n\nhttps://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0595/2021-03/AArch64-Registers/ZCR-EL1--SVE-Control-Register--EL1-",
      "parentUuid": "70092345_91d4f78c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 211,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 211,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "46111e069dca90a7935188ddd0caf2dcacced1b3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
