      "writtenOn": "2023-03-15T13:45:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the latest patch this is irrelevant (and gone), since as long as we are consistent, we can always save/restore using the max value as the offset.\n\nThis does not affect the vector size itself, which is determined by ZCR_EL2.",
